{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the locale-independent page registry.",
    "Read by src/content/registry.ts (typed, build-time) and directly by",
    "scripts/*.mjs (plain Node cannot import TypeScript). One data file read by",
    "both sides is deliberate: a generated sidecar could drift, this cannot.",
    "Documentation lives in registry.ts, since JSON carries no comments.",
    "Per-locale page COPY lives elsewhere: src/content/tools/<locale>/<slug>.ts",
    "for tools, src/i18n/locales/<locale>.ts for editorial pages."
